{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 15/07/2024, the proposal as shown on the Unnumbered Location Plan submitted on  10/07/2024, ChargeArm User Manual submitted on 11/07/2024, Unnumbered Existing Floor Plan and Unnumbered Proposed Site Plan submitted on 22/07/2024 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class D of Part 2 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the proposed charging point would be within 2 metres of the pavement, which is a highway.\r\n"
